1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,000
A PR that quietly stops charging for quantity.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,300
You can see the fix. The PR page can't help you write it.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:15,500
So reviewers describe the fix in prose, or hand-build a suggestion block…

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:26,000
…instead: fix it in the file, with your LSP and your keys.

5
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:34,500
One key turns that edit into the suggestion.

6
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:39,500
Posted — and the edit is undone. Your tree matches the PR again.

7
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,000
review-mode.nvim
